<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE OF PAKISTAN TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE OF PAKISTAN TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Golden Jubilee</p>
<p>of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Netherlands 3 Australia 2 (halftime 1-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Netherlands - Bram Lomans 28, 49, Stephan Veen 54</p>
<p>Australia - Baedan Choppy 4, Jay Stacy 28</p>
<p>Pakistan 1 England 1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pakistan - Muhammad Shahbaz 35</p>
<p>England - Russell Garcia 30</p>
</text>
